WEBVTT Line breaks after start tags

NOTE A line break right after a cue span start tag belongs to that span.

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
<i>
Previously on the show</i> we met the team.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
<v Ann>
Hello there</v>

00:05.000 --> 00:07.000
Text before <b>
<u>bold and underlined</u> text</b>

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000
<v Bob>No line break after this start tag</v>
